# ==============================================================================
# QUANT SCANNER SCHEDULES
# Cron Format: [Min] [Hour] [Day-of-Month] [Month] [Day-of-Week] [User] [Command]
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Breakout Scanner
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs: Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri at 17:17 (5:17 PM EDT)
# Details: Loads system environment variables, runs the core breakout daily scan,
#          and appends execution output to cron.log.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 17 17 * * 1-5 root . /etc/environment; quant-daily >> /app/logs/cron.log 2>&1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Peter Lynch Value Scanner
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs: Fridays only at 18:17 (6:17 PM EDT)
# Details: Loads system environment variables, runs the weekly lynch valuation 
#          analysis, compiles both types of reports, archives results, 
#          and appends logs to cron.log.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 17 18 * * 5 root . /etc/environment; quant-lynch --report both --archive >> /app/logs/cron.log 2>&1